WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.027
I've been building a small project called

00:00:03.027 --> 00:00:03.960
Office Town.

00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:07.547
It started with how I use AI to write code.

00:00:07.547 --> 00:00:10.112
I often have several sessions open,

00:00:10.112 --> 00:00:13.509
working on my training platform while editing a

00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:14.827
Xiaohongshu post.

00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:18.214
I'd like to keep that work going when I'm away

00:00:18.214 --> 00:00:19.370
from my computer.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.195
Check where the code got to,

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:22.899
see what needs a decision,

00:00:22.899 --> 00:00:25.881
and reply from my phone so the original session

00:00:25.881 --> 00:00:26.793
can continue.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.317
That's why I made this app.

00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:31.657
Each employee is an AI session.

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.990
Open one to see what it recently did and what

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.260
it's waiting for me to answer.

00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:39.999
For this training platform task,

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:43.207
I send the status display requirements from my

00:00:43.207 --> 00:00:43.742
phone,

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:46.483
and Codex on my computer keeps working.

00:00:46.483 --> 00:00:49.624
Then I can come back and read the changes and

00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:50.627
test results.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.079
For the Xiaohongshu draft,

00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:56.323
I can keep choosing a title and editing the

00:00:56.323 --> 00:00:56.827
text,

00:00:56.827 --> 00:00:57.260
too.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.294
When there are too many chats to check,

00:01:04.294 --> 00:01:08.314
I ask the butler: what needs my attention now?

00:01:08.314 --> 00:01:12.334
It reads the task records and finds the things

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.260
waiting for my reply.

00:01:14.727 --> 00:01:17.891
I'm also trying to let the butler handle more

00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:19.170
of the follow-up.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.593
I set the goal and what it may do,

00:01:21.593 --> 00:01:24.892
and enable replies when I want it to send them.

00:01:24.892 --> 00:01:26.776
It stops when it's unsure,

00:01:26.776 --> 00:01:28.527
and I review the result.

00:01:28.993 --> 00:01:29.512
First,

00:01:29.512 --> 00:01:32.686
I want to keep developing when I'm away from my

00:01:32.686 --> 00:01:33.398
computer.

00:01:33.398 --> 00:01:33.852
Then,

00:01:33.852 --> 00:01:34.629
gradually,

00:01:34.629 --> 00:01:37.674
let the butler follow up on more of the tasks

00:01:37.674 --> 00:01:39.293
I've already explained.
